ame></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUTAMURA TSUYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KIDA SHINZO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SATO KIYOMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUTAMURA, TSUYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIDA, SHINZO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SATO, KIYOMI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>In an apparatus for and method of detecting a foreign matter in a raw material, plural specified wavelength components of infrared ray or ultraviolet ray are irradiated toward a raw material (T) on a conveyer (2), reflection intensities of the specified wavelength components reflected from the raw material (T) are measured, the measured reflection intensities are compared with reflection intensities of the specified wavelength components inherent to the raw material (T) and, on the basis of the comparison result, the foreign matter is detected.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un appareil et un procédé de détection d'une matière étrangère dans une matière première, ce procédé consistant à irradier de plusieurs composantes de longueurs d'ondes spécifiques de rayons infrarouges ou ultraviolets une matière première (T) se trouvant sur une bande transporteuse (2); mesurer les intensités de réflexion des composantes de longueurs d'ondes spécifiques renvoyées par la matière première (T), comparer ces intensités de réflexion mesurées aux intensités de réflexion des composantes de longueurs d'ondes spécifiques inhérentes à la matière première (T), et sur la base de cette comparaison, détecter la matière étrangère.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>